{"unit_id":"gongstudent__dsh-quote-to-agent#feature-selection","repo":"gongstudent/dsh-quote-to-agent","commit":"af39203c9c98625180d621cbe1a4b1d0ddd99707","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quote-to-agent 的功能「选区动作条」：在会话记录中选中一段文本后显示动作条，可选择引用到当前会话、主对话或子智能体；选区会被整理并限制在 2000 字符。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:350-405"]}
{"unit_id":"gongstudent__dsh-quote-to-agent#feature-quote-bar","repo":"gongstudent/dsh-quote-to-agent","commit":"af39203c9c98625180d621cbe1a4b1d0ddd99707","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quote-to-agent 的功能「引用条」：引用内容会暂存在目标会话输入框上方的引用条中，可展开查看并逐条删除；发送时引用文本会拼入消息草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:851-938"]}
{"unit_id":"gongstudent__dsh-quote-to-agent#feature-subagent-routing","repo":"gongstudent/dsh-quote-to-agent","commit":"af39203c9c98625180d621cbe1a4b1d0ddd99707","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quote-to-agent 的功能「子会话投递」：选择一个团队成员或子智能体后，插件会在右侧打开对应会话并放入引用；一次性只读子任务不会接收后续引用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:425-476"]}
{"unit_id":"gongstudent__dsh-quote-to-agent#feature-spawn-followup","repo":"gongstudent/dsh-quote-to-agent","commit":"af39203c9c98625180d621cbe1a4b1d0ddd99707","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quote-to-agent 的功能「无目标时派生」：没有子智能体可选时，动作会把派生指令和引用写入当前草稿，并等待新子会话出现后尝试打开并投递引用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1361-1450"]}
